[[Eathon Lambert]] hid away the prophecies in his [[Holotome]]. The [[Huntik Foundation]] was able to decipher them after recovering Nostradamus' [[Nostradamus' Scrying Glass|scrying glass]]. {{source|The Tower of Nostradamus}}

The final prophecy recovered in [[Nostradamus' Tomb]] turned out to be a fake created by [[The Betrayer]] to trick [[Lok Lambert]] into breaking the seal of the [[Spiral Mark]] with the [[Willblade]], and set the [[Red Comet]] to hit Earth. {{Source|S2E49}}

Ultimately, a real quatrain of Nostradamus' was used to defeat him for good. {{source|Dante's Return}}
